{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_97CBA4D6","title":"Gan talks about suckin'","entry":"Dlg_97CBA4D6::entry","exit":"Dlg_97CBA4D6::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_9A0354CE","articyId":"72057752951742536","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gan Coilson","text":"Thanks again for the assist friend.","speakerId":"Ntt_6A22389B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Thanks again for the assist friend.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":25.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40826","byteOffset":29771872,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_8EF644D5","articyId":"72057752951742544","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gan Coilson","text":"It sucks... get it? Look, it’s not glamorous, but it beats being screamed at for \"forgetting to feel.\" And hey, floors don’t argue back.","speakerId":"Ntt_6A22389B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It sucks... get it? Look, it’s not glamorous, but it beats being screamed at for \"forgetting to feel.\" And hey, floors don’t argue back.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":625.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31658","byteOffset":19857512,"byteLength":484}},{"id":"DFr_3D535F81","articyId":"72057752951742558","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gan Coilson","text":"Difficult is polite. Living with her was like arguing with a hailstorm.","speakerId":"Ntt_6A22389B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Difficult is polite. Living with her was like arguing with a hailstorm.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":1250.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20405","byteOffset":15602464,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_14194805","articyId":"72057752951742572","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gan Coilson","text":"Technicalities don’t matter when someone’s yelling at you about the Hetherington's Country Club gala ball. It felt real enough.","speakerId":"Ntt_6A22389B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Technicalities don’t matter when someone’s yelling at you about the Hetherington's Country Club gala ball. It felt real enough.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":1850.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17322","byteOffset":14442032,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_0FA9A9FD","articyId":"72057752951742586","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gan Coilson","text":"Well if that's the case, she can grieve properly now I'm gone again. Now, If you'll excuse me, there's a really grimy bit of rat paste over there I've had my eye on for quite some time... that's it, come here you sassy minx.","speakerId":"Ntt_6A22389B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well if that's the case, she can grieve properly now I'm gone again. Now, If you'll excuse me, there's a really grimy bit of rat paste over there I've had my eye on for quite some time... that's it, come here you sassy minx.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18898","byteOffset":15036872,"byteLength":532}},{"id":"DFr_36BC5990","articyId":"72057752951742600","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gan Coilson","text":"Ohhhh boy I feel things. I can feel all sorts. Sadness, joy, the familiar vibration as you suck a dead termite up your pipe hole. Vrrrrrrr.","speakerId":"Ntt_6A22389B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ohhhh boy I feel things. I can feel all sorts. Sadness, joy, the familiar vibration as you suck a dead termite up your pipe hole. Vrrrrrrr.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":1250.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40075","byteOffset":29490072,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_F8D5A3DB","articyId":"72057752951742529","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Do you enjoy being a vacuum cleaner?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Do you enjoy being a vacuum cleaner?","TextSheVersion":"Do you enjoy being a vacuum cleaner?","TextTheyVersion":"Do you enjoy being a vacuum cleaner?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":325.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24544","byteOffset":17161392,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_1A089B36","articyId":"72057752951742551","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Yeah Ceres seems... difficult.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah Ceres seems... difficult.","TextSheVersion":"Yeah Ceres seems... difficult.","TextTheyVersion":"Yeah Ceres seems... difficult."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":950.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18501","byteOffset":14885352,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_76FEC35E","articyId":"72057752951742565","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"If you're just a persona construct, I guess she isn't technically your actual wife?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If you're just a persona construct, I guess she isn't technically your actual wife?","TextSheVersion":"If you'r